    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44599" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔοικ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with good houses</i>, 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐβύριον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				389.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>convenient to inhabit, comfortable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.370
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>good economist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.39
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>kind to servants</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκέται</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				Achae.
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
